// Level of detail on the models swamp1.bsp has baked in (triangle soups that keep their
// model's collapse map), from above the rock by the swamp tree at -4352 -4052, a soup
// that goes from 197 vertexes down to its minLod of 143. Shot 0 has the default
// r_lodscale of 5, shot 1 has 0.05, where retail and ours drop the same pieces of the
// tree's trunk and branches. Over half the retail soups never reduce: their minLod is
// all their vertexes (the branches and plants by the player's start, for one).
probe:
waitforplayer
wait 25
spawn Camera targetname lodcam origin "-3765 -4338 1200" angles "5 154 0"
wait .2
cuecamera $lodcam
wait 1
stuffcmd "screenshot"
wait 1
stuffcmd "set r_lodscale 0.05"
wait .5
stuffcmd "screenshot"
wait 1
stuffcmd "set r_lodscale 5"
wait .5
stuffcmd "quit"
end
